Dead code is removed from the foundation-model backends: the zero forward pass every braindecode model ran at load to measure a width nothing read, the restore path for single-module checkpoints that coco-pipe no longer writes, the `bind_signal_metadata` hook that only test doubles had, and `get_failure_diagnostics`, which always returned `{}` (it is also gone from the `NeuralTrainable` protocol, and the fine-tune artifact metadata loses its empty `failures` entry).
